    "def adf_p(x):\n",
    "    return adfuller(x.dropna(), autolag=\"AIC\")[1]\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "pd.DataFrame({name: {\"level\": adf_p(s.iloc[:split[name]]),\n",
    "                     \"1st difference\": adf_p(s.iloc[:split[name]].diff()),\n",
    "                     \"2nd difference\": adf_p(s.iloc[:split[name]].diff().diff())}\n",
    "              for name, s in prices.items()}).T.round(4).rename_axis(\"ADF p-value\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "52d952c6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The closing prices have a unit root (p ≈ 0.93).\n",
    "After second-order differencing, the ADF test rejects the unit root (p ≈ 0), so **d = 2**. The first difference also passes."
   ]
  },
