  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "219bcdfe",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Reading the plots:**\n",
    "* **ACF:** one large negative spike at lag 1 (≈ −0.5), then it cuts off.\n",
    "* **PACF:** tails off gradually.\n",
    "\n",
    "That is the MA(1) signature, so the model is **ARIMA(0,2,1)** for both series."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a4e55dd5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## ARIMA(0,2,1)\n",
    "Fitted on the training set. The coefficients are then frozen, and the model gives a one-step-ahead forecast for every day: each day's forecast uses closes up to the day before."
   ]
  },
